Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, G5, let's step on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Tashigi needs us\Nto save those children!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Caesar's not the\Nonly Logia type here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that, but either\Nway, she's out of our league.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Blackleg, while we're on the subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't you help when you\Nstarted trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stronger than\Nall of us put together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kick a woman no\Nmatter how evil she is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if it came down to\Na matter of life and death?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose death. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all in the same crew, but\Nthey're so different from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just look at that\Npirate hunter's orb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed like the type\Nof person who would
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,chop you to bits if you\Neven looked at him funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's got a sensitive side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll find a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.60,0:03:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the same thing goes for Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters now is tracking\Ndown that group of rugrats so Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin, and Tashigi will tell\Nus we did a good job! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're entitled to your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel, then am I entitled\Nto cut you up first, Miss Navy Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.84,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't put a scratch on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Or her, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you're letting me live
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.48,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because i'm a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,jeez woman do you ever\Nshut your damn mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,listen you get the same exact\Nface as some chick i knew who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,died so i can't stand the sight\Nof you on top of that i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,know a thing about you yet and\Nyou're already talking just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,like her why the hell are you\Ncopying her just try to be herself
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.84,0:04:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe you ought to think before you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you think that women aren't as strong you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,hold back in a fight so\Nyou can't kill her can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you you're never gonna\Nsucceed that way that's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,why i stayed because\Nyou're not up to the task
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,with the powers that she's got if she\Ngets near my men i know it won't be pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,are you trying to say\Nyou're better than me yes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had it. Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.28,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to keep her\Nclaws off my comrades too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you know As long as someone keeps\Nher busy, what's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so flippant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better run while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One bite and you're dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to you, I've just\Ndiscovered his weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have your Haki, but that\Nwon't be enough to save you from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.34,0:05:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use Haki to force a power\Nuser like me back to my normal state.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, you have to be fast\Nenough to catch up with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're colder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the snow woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Care for a snowball fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Smoker's right-hand girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I end you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go find your troops and say, your\Npoor captain just couldn't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She bit it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let go, I'll lose my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a chance, but if\Nyou'd rather, I tear you apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.34,0:07:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't been running your\Nmouth, you'd be done with her by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.44,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy, so let's make\Nthis quick, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.18,0:07:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn he wouldn't cut a\Nwoman, but it looks like I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He swung at me without\Na moment's hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've misjudged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.32,0:07:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I don't go around\Ncutting just anyone, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're face to face with an\Nanimal that can rip you to shreds,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:07:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't take any chances, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.30,0:08:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,One sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Great dragon shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we're done here. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.56,0:08:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,how dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she not die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't use his haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She lost control of her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have been\Npetrified when she realized
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.82,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,that she'd die if Zoro used his Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the Straw Hat Pirates were
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.16,0:09:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,doing during those two\Nyears they went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How much stronger are they now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Autumn rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.47,0:09:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything you said, you\Nstill didn't try to kill that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.98,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't recall asking you to\Nfinish my fight for me, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't killed her, I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You just stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stepped in because you were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody forced you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.38,0:10:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, Miss Four Eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead, so she can't\Nhurt anyone else anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.56,0:10:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind if you take the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you be more patronizing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're better than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing, raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sedative.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to me? Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, go after the children! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.80,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here with our kitty, Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.58,0:11:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Milky Hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.34,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to keep this up long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How much further does Mocha have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.46,0:11:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.62,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which way to go anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The toxic gas is flowing\Ninto the biscuit room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit's in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have told me sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you at least put me down\Nbefore we catch up with my men?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow your pride for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like it'll do you\Nany good if you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the legendary sword shoestring?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your hands to yourself and stop\Nrunning your mouth, you stupid sword geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.24,0:12:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop this! Mocha! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them took another route!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Mocha! Mocha! Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If they get the candy, we'll\Nhave to start all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.94,0:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get Mocha away from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to get away from this\Nstupid island and go back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She ate all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair! Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What was she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Gabby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't just look at all! Gabby!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to spit them all out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me? Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you what those candies really are!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still spit them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I think we\Nshould do when we grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We should find a ship and\Nset out for the open sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, to catch fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, dummy, to go on an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, look for islands made\Nof gold and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get better and go home,\Nwe'll be separated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't see each other anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need a\Nship, to pick everyone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cool, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.02,0:14:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of friends having a big adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.12,0:14:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when we're 20 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's like forever from now—waiting for\Nso long will just make it more exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,okay, let's make it a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,the master is a bad person, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A very bad person!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,person But he's always been\Nso nice to us the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He gives us is yummy and\Nwe get to eat it every day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he trapped you. What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You children aren't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,his test subjects. How...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,how do you know? Hey, Mocha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.02,0:14:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go to the\Nbiscuit room right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, none of you were\Nsick when he brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think you wound\Nup with a body that enormous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors about experiments that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,have been going on for\Nhundreds of years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,People all around the world\Nattempting to create giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I say attempting because nobody\Nhas ever succeeded before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The experiments always fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but there's something\Nthat I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's experiment is doomed too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows that it's going to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess is he's just collecting\Ndata for his next experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.18,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's going to happen to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you will live to see home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That delicious candy is a fatal toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.80,0:16:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes sweet, but the truth\Nis, it's destroying your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as you eat one,\Nyou start to crave another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The more you eat, the more\Ncontrol Caesar has over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, you'll do\Nanything for another piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like those kids in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I sedated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're calm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are side effects from the\Ncandy and the experiment itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.66,0:16:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you reach adulthood,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you will likely die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't ever be grown-ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.88,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What about our homes,\Nour mommies and daddies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we get to see them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't, unless you leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of things have scared us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We never even thought about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When we asked you for help, it was\Nbecause we wanted to go home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.22,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted the chance to see\Nour families instead of being
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,stuck here another year without\Nknowing what we were sick with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We never...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We never actually thought that we\Nwere going to die here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought we were going to\Nleave here once we got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he said, and we believed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, we ate that candy\Nbecause they gave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know we would die from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault. None of this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're gonna do whatever\Nit takes to defeat Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will stop us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.76,0:17:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry that we didn't get here\Nsooner to save you from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:17:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find a way to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's powerful, devious, and maybe the\Nmost horrible man in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But you should know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our captain is better\Nthan him and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact, he's going\Nto be king of the pirates someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.31,0:18:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, Luffy is\Ngoing to take Caesar down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So please listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the other\Nchildren have any more candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.67,0:18:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do my best to\Nget them all sedated here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That should make them easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,To control but I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can go to the\Nbiscuit room and guard the candies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever I have to do, I'll make\Nsure nobody eats any more candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want us all to escape together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she puked blood. Why though?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.18,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All she did was eat the candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She really doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The children have stopped now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.14,0:19:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you're greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? See now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what eating the\Ncandy really does to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.66,0:19:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, sacrifice yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, if you want to sedate\Nthem, then now is your best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.24,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, first I have to treat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No time, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The children are standing still!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No violence, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just subdued!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not injure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.06,0:20:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Navy? Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's aiming for the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Balls considered violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A close call, but yes. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.80,0:20:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical team, you're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, use these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They know a thing or two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.19,0:20:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get these kiddos a little calmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm correct, there should be an\Nexamination room somewhere around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get her there as fast as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that, right, Raccoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough chit-chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't let them have the candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eating the candy to save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, they'll be\Nable to escape from here.
