Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.64,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.10,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Caesar?
